## Date: 2026-06-06

See `/root/work/method-sourcing-board/burckhardt-reflection-extracts.md` for full verified extracts with German originals + English translations.

Key verified passages:
- Three Potencies (die drei Potenzen): State, Religion, Culture — non-coordinateable, dynamic
- Querschnitt method: cross-sectional analysis in present tense, type-focused
- Crises as Revelation: crisis exposes true structure of civilization
- Terrible Simplifiers (furchtbaren Vereinfacher): those who reduce complex realities to simple formulas
